{"2710530":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Rug Cleaning Simulator","steam_appid":2710530,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn filthy rugs into satisfying before-and-after transformations while running your own rug-cleaning business.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on customer jobs, work through every stage of the cleaning process, earn money, upgrade your equipment, and improve your shop as your business grows.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SATISFYING CLEANING<\/h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rug starts as a mess.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different tools and machines to remove dirt step by step and watch each rug slowly return to its former glory.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time, enjoy the process, and experience the satisfaction of turning something filthy into something spotless.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.poster.avif?t=1793722093\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.webm?t=1793722093\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.mp4?t=1793722093\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN YOUR OWN RUG-CLEANING BUSINESS<\/h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers bring rugs to your shop looking for help.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept new jobs, clean their rugs, get paid, and reinvest your earnings into better equipment and improvements for your business.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small and gradually build a rug-cleaning shop you can be proud of.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY JOB IS DIFFERENT<\/h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work on a variety of rugs with different patterns, sizes, and levels of dirt.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated customers and jobs help keep each workday fresh while always giving you the same satisfying goal:<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the rug clean again.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/b8ec607d899c492bbdc8aa155b66ad82.poster.avif?t=1793722093\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/b8ec607d899c492bbdc8aa155b66ad82.webm?t=1793722093\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/b8ec607d899c492bbdc8aa155b66ad82.mp4?t=1793722093\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR EQUIPMENT<\/h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with basic cleaning equipment and unlock better tools and machines as you progress.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your earnings into upgrades that make your work faster, easier, and more satisfying.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/ea6aa4b4ef4f055bf7fb128a59ce1414.poster.avif?t=1793722093\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/ea6aa4b4ef4f055bf7fb128a59ce1414.webm?t=1793722093\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/ea6aa4b4ef4f055bf7fb128a59ce1414.mp4?t=1793722093\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE THE SHOP YOURS<\/h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your workplace is more than just a place to clean rugs.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you earn to improve and customize your shop and gradually turn a small operation into a successful business.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.poster.avif?t=1793722093\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.webm?t=1793722093\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2710530\/extras\/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.mp4?t=1793722093\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELAX AND ENJOY THE PROCESS<\/h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no need to rush.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the next customer job, work through the cleaning process at your own pace, and enjoy the simple satisfaction of watching dirt disappear.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean rugs.<br>Earn money.<br>Upgrade your equipment.<br>Improve your shop.<br>Take on the next job.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn filthy rugs into satisfying before-and-after transformations while running your own rug-cleaning business.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on customer jobs, work through every stage of the cleaning process, earn money, upgrade your equipment, and improve your shop as your business grows.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SATISFYING CLEANING<\/h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rug starts as a mess.<\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different tools and machines to r